    [
     {
      "type": "icon_list",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "subtitle": "无纸化办公",
        "icon": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/8/csm_ZNU_Standard-LabelWirtschaft_Beschaffung_885b49702b.webp",
         "alt": "",
         "w": 125,
         "h": 125
        },
        "value": "25%",
        "text": "<p>通过ABAS和ELO中的数字化流程，我们每年都在减少纸张消耗。2024年，按员工人数计算，纸张消耗量减少了25%。</p>",
        "content": "<h3>25%</h3>"
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "zoller_icon-list",
      "id": "c3145",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
